                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_141050203">During failsafe logic test the watchdog status feedback from the system chip is tested against several patterns according to the ongoing sub test. If the watchdog status is not as expected this fault is logged.</SD>
