                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1871913454">The failsafe logic test tests whether the system chip can switch off the gate actuation of the valve relay via SPI command. If the feedback does not show a switched off valve relay gate this fault is set.</SD>
