                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1182439230">After the failsafe logic test has finished the ECU internal enable lines are monitored. It is expected that the enable lines always stay at high level (except the SW intends another state). If this is not the case this fault is logged.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
