                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1449311067">TPI will save a copy of the coding to NVM. During ignition on TPI will read the coding from NVM and check the validity. The coding error will be raised if any of the recieved coding parameters has an invalid value. The error will be healed during the next ignition cycle if valid coding parameters have been recieved</SD>
