                                <DTC ID="DTCC2493AE" OID="88c3f01d-cf46-4f46-ac2f-8ce8e45836b7">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCC2493AE</SHORT-NAME>
                                    <TROUBLE-CODE>6591406</TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>C2493AE</DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <TEXT TI="TI_1894960514">NVM_MemoryError</TEXT>
                                    <SDGS>
                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1486845611">-</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1324365006">Algorithm runs in third party supplier</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1466836175">One or more of the following:1. Read request denied, the status for NvmSrvDebug block was returned asSRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_FAILED from RTE.2. Read request denied, the status for NvmSrvParam block was returned asSRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_FAILED from RTE.3. Read request denied, the status for NvmSrvDem block was returned asSRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_FAILED from RTE.4. Read request denied, the status for one of the TPI NVM blocks was returned as SRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_FAILED from RTE.5. Write request denied, the status for NvmSrvDebug block was returnedas SRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_FAILED from RTE.6. Write request denied, the status for NvmSrvParam block was returnedas SRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_FAILED from RTE.7. Write request denied, the status for NvmSrvDem block was returned asSRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_FAILED from RTE.8. Write request denied, the status for one of the TPI NVM blocks wasreturned as SRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_FAILED from RTE.9. Timeout, the status for NvmSrvDebug block was returned as SRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_IN_PROGRESS from RTE for more than 10 seconds.10. Timeout, the status for NvmSrvParam block was returned asSRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_IN_PROGRESS from RTE for morethan 10 seconds.11. Timeout, the status for NvmSrvDem block was returned asSRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_IN_PROGRESS from RTE for morethan 10 seconds.12. Timeout, the status for one of the TPI NVM blocks was returned asSRVNVM_BLOCK_OPERATION_IN_PROGRESS from RTE for morethan 10 seconds.13. The checksum of the NvmSrvDebug block was incorrect.14. The checksum of the NvmSrvParam block was incorrect.15. The checksum of the NvmSrvDem block was incorrect.16. The checksum of one of the TPI NVM blocks was incorrect.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
