                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_192121140">The Algorithm cyclically compares the current read values of the button configuration register with the value written in the init task. The init values are written again in the ASIC if the monitoring fails once but a fault is logged if the monitoring fails again.</SD>
