                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_935501655">The FreewheelingPathTest is a cyclic test (every 20s outside motor actuation) to check, if Freewheeling (FW) FET and the ReverseVoltageProtection (RVP) FET is switchable. Additionally an interrupted motor, interrupted pin connections and interruptions in the complete comparator circuit and FWD path are detected.</SD>
