                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_204539390">Software /Hardware trigger Wss test is done by Multi IC to check for WSS_RR(Short circuit of WSS_supply line to UBATT, short circuits between sensor lines, or any WSS line failure).</SD>
