                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_596803557">The failure is set if more than one WSS failure suspicion is set (at the same time). These WSS failure suspicions are set by other wheel speed monitorings.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
