                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_709643258">The H-Bridge driver ASIC is monitoring the Drain-Source voltage in case a transistor in the H-bridge is switched on. The software is reading the Drain-Source monitoring failure bits continiously.</SD>
